abstract: >-
  Frozen research artifact accompanying the JAMIA 2026 manuscript "Deers Rock: A Deterministic
  Micro-Simulation of a Tier A Referral Hospital in Eastern Indonesia". Contains the final
  manuscript and the frozen E1 baseline experiment artifacts (10 seeds x 1,000 ticks). Deers Rock
  is a deterministic, seeded healthcare micro-simulation; all clinical parameters are
  plausibility-based and uncalibrated, and no clinical-validity or predictive claims are made.
